  "_about": "After the user's own mockup (D · Artifact), generated by tools/gen_artifact.py (edit that and regenerate): speed on a glass chevron frame at the left (SPEED_SCALE) and revs on its mirror at the right (0..8, red from the redline), each lit brighter from the bottom up to a white marker; the speed and the gear in big italic figures, a slanted fuel gauge (left) and oil gauge (right) inside the frames, and in the middle (setting artCenter) a car seen from above with each tyre's pressure and temperature, the four readouts, or nothing. While the Waze map shows inside the theme ('mapUp') the middle is cut see-through with its edges fading to black (mapLive: no rebuild). Everything that isn't text is one shader (xdash). The bottom row has the range, the clock, the drive mode, the outside and coolant temperatures, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
